# macOS
.DS_Store

# Product/business docs — kept local only, not on GitHub (private repo or
# not, still sensitive: lean canvas, MVP report, full tech spec)
# Path corrected 2026-09-17: docs moved from Laju/documents/ to documents/
# at repo root during the 6-folder reorganization; the old pattern silently
# stopped matching anything, leaving documents/ untracked-but-not-ignored.
# `documents/*` (not `documents/`) so the two `!` exceptions below can re-include specific files —
# git cannot un-ignore a path inside a directory excluded by a plain directory-matching pattern.
documents/*
# Narrow exception (2026-09-22, explicit user decision): these two files need to reach a new
# Claude Code session on a different device via `git clone` — everything else in documents/ (20+
# files, lean canvas, MVP report, full tech spec) stays local-only, unchanged from the rule above.
!documents/HANDOFF.md
!documents/README.md

# Claude Code local session/agent config — not project source
.claude/

# iOS (ios/ has its own .gitignore for Xcode-specific patterns —
# DerivedData, generated Laju.xcodeproj, xcuserdata, .build, .swiftpm)

# Backend (Next.js/TypeScript, tech-spec.md §1) — empty until T2.1, these
# patterns are here ready for when it's populated
backend/node_modules/
backend/.next/
backend/dist/
backend/.env
backend/.env.local
backend/.env*.local
backend/npm-debug.log*
backend/.vercel/
backend/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
backend/next-env.d.ts

# Supabase CLI local link state (T2.1) — `.temp/` holds session-local
# project-ref/pooler-url cache from `supabase link`; standard Supabase CLI
# convention is to never commit it.
backend/supabase/.temp/
backend/supabase/.branches/
